INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('zoonk/zoonk/zoonk-issue-writer', 'zoonk-issue-writer', 'zoonk', 'zoonk', 'community', 'zoonk-issue-writer zoonk zoonk community ai better-auth education learning nextjs postgres prisma shadcn-ui tailwindcss vercel vercel-ai-sdk The zoonk-issue-writer skill generates well-written user stories from structured issue breakdowns, providing engineers with context for implementation. It acts as a product owner layer, utilizing technologies like Next.js, Postgres, and Prisma. zoonk-issue-writer是一个将结构化问题分解转化为详细用户故事的AI工具，支持Next.js、Postgres、Prisma等技术 zoonk-issue-writerは、Next.js、Postgres、Prismaなどをサポートする、構造化された問題分解を詳細なユーザーストーリーに変換するAIエージェントです zoonk-issue-writer는 구조화된 문제 분해를 상세한 사용자 스토리로 변환하는 AI 에이전트로, Next.js, Postgres, Prisma 등을 지원합니다 zoonk-issue-writer es una habilidad que escribe historias de usuario detalladas a partir de planes de implementación y las publica en GitHub utilizando tecnologías como NextJS, Prisma y Tailwind CSS zoonk-issue-writer est une compétence qui rédige des histoires utilisateur détaillées à partir de plans de mise en œuvre et les publie sur GitHub en utilisant des technologies comme NextJS, Prisma et Tailwind CSS zoonk-issue-writer ist eine Fähigkeit, die detaillierte Benutzerstories aus Implementierungsplänen erstellt und auf GitHub mit Technologien wie NextJS, Prisma und Tailwind CSS veröffentlicht O zoonk-issue-writer é uma habilidade que cria histórias de usuário detalhadas a partir de planos de implementação. Ele utiliza tecnologias como NextJS, Prisma e TailwindCSS. Zoonk-issue-writer - это навык, который создает детальные истории пользователей из планов реализации. Он использует технологии như NextJS, Prisma и TailwindCSS. زونك-إيشو-رايتير هو مهارة يقوم بإنشاء قصص مستخدم مفصلة من خطط التنفيذ. إنه يستخدم تكنولوجيا مثل NextJS و Prisma و TailwindCSS how to use zoonk-issue-writer zoonk-issue-writer setup guide zoonk-issue-writer alternative zoonk-issue-writer vs Jira zoonk-issue-writer install what is zoonk-issue-writer zoonk-issue-writer GitHub integration zoonk-issue-writer AI agent skill zoonk-issue-writer AI工具 Next.js Postgres Prisma Shadcn-ui Vercel Vercel AI SDK Tailwind CSS 问题分解 Transforms structured issue breakdowns from zoonk-issue-planning into well-written user stories Utilizes Next.js for building and Vercel for deployment Leverages Prisma for database interactions and Postgres for data storage Employs Shadcn UI and Tailwind CSS for user interface styling Posts detailed user stories to GitHub for engineer context Acts as a product owner layer, providing implementation context without dictating implementation zoonk-issue-writer is a skill that takes implementation plans and breaks them down into detailed user stories, posted to GitHub, using technologies like Shadcn UI and Tailwind CSS.');
