INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('charlietlamb/ferix/Convex Security Audit', 'Convex Security Audit', 'charlietlamb', 'ferix', 'community', 'Convex Security Audit charlietlamb ferix community The Convex Security Audit skill provides a centralized hub for comprehensive security review patterns, benefiting developers of Convex applications. It ensures authorization logic, data access boundaries, and rate limiting are properly implemented. Convex 安全审计提供了全面安全审查模式，包括授权逻辑、数据访问边界、操作隔离、速率限制等 Convex セキュリティ監査は、認証ロジック、データアクセス境界、操作の分離、レート制限など、包括的なセキュリティレビューパターンを提供する Convex 보안 감사는 권한 부여 논리, 데이터 액세스 경계, 동작 분리, 레이트 제한 등을 포함하는 종합적인 보안 검토 패턴을 제공한다 Convex Security Audit es una herramienta centralizada para revisar la seguridad de aplicaciones Convex, incluyendo lógica de autorización y límites de velocidad Convex Security Audit est un outil centralisé pour examiner la sécurité des applications Convex, y compris la logique d''autorisation et les limites de débit Convex Security Audit ist ein zentrales Tool zur Überprüfung der Sicherheit von Convex-Anwendungen, einschließlich Autorisierungslogik und Rate Limiting O Convex Security Audit é uma ferramenta de revisão de segurança abrangente para aplicações Convex, incluindo lógica de autorização e isolamento de ações Convex Security Audit - это комплексный инструмент проверки безопасности для приложений Convex, включая логику авторизации и изоляцию действий Convex Security Audit هو أداة مراجعة أمن شاملة للتطبيقات Convex، بما في ذلك منطق التعريف والمعزل الإجرائي Convex Security Audit setup guide how to use Convex Security Audit what is Convex Security Audit Convex Security Audit alternative Convex Security Audit vs competitor Convex Security Audit install Convex application security best practices authorization logic implementation in Convex Convex 安全审计 Convex 应用安全 AI工具安全 Convex 安全设置 Convex 应用优化 安全审查模式 Comprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications Authorization logic implementation using Convex functions auth Data access boundary protection as per https://docs.convex.dev/production Action isolation and rate limiting for sensitive operations Documentation sources from https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth and https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt Convex Security Audit is a security review framework for Convex applications, focusing on authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, and rate limiting.');
