e Python","Sichere und verifizierte KI-Schlußfolgerung","Zugriff auf den Beispieldordner für eine einfache Referenz"],"pt":["SDK Python para inferência de IA verificável","Exemplos e tutoriais práticos para começar","Integração com a plataforma OpenGradient","Suporte a aplicações de IA confiáveis","Código fonte aberto e personalizável"],"ru":["SDK Python для верифицируемой инференции ИИ","Практические примеры и уроки для начала работы","Интеграция с платформой OpenGradient","Поддержка надежных приложений ИИ","Открытый и настраиваемый исходный код"],"ar":["SDK بايثون للاستدلال الذكي القابل للتحقق","أمثلة ودروس عملية للبدء","التكامل مع منصة OpenGradient","دعم تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي موثوقة","كود مفتوح ويمكن تخصيصه"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use opengradient","opengradient alternative","opengradient install","what is opengradient","opengradient vs TensorFlow","opengradient setup guide","opengradient Python SDK tutorial","verifiable AI inference with opengradient","OpenGradient Python SDK examples"],"zh":["OpenGradient Python SDK","可验证 AI 推理","Python 库","AIエージェント","可验证的 AI","Python 开发","AI 推理库"],"ja":["OpenGradient Python SDK","可証的 AI 推論","Python ライブラリ","AIエージェント","可証的 AI","Python 開発","AI 推論ライブラリ"],"ko":["OpenGradient Python SDK","검증 가능한 AI 추론","Python 라이브러리","AI 에이전트","검증 가능한 AI","Python 개발","AI 추론 라이브러리"],"es":["OpenGradient","SDK de Python","inferencia de IA verificable","ejemplos de OpenGradient","tutoriales de OpenGradient","desarrollo de IA con Python","herramientas de IA para Python","agentes de IA","herramientas de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["OpenGradient","SDK Python","inférence d''IA vérifiable","exemples d''OpenGradient","didacticiels d''OpenGradient","développement d''IA avec Python","outils d''IA pour Python","agents d''IA","outils d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["OpenGradient","Python-SDK","verifizierte KI-Schlußfolgerung","Beispiele von OpenGradient","Tutorien von OpenGradient","Entwicklung von KI mit Python","Tools für KI mit Python","KI-Agents","Tools für künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["OpenGradient","SDK Python","Inferência de IA verificável","Desenvolvimento de IA","Ferramentas de IA","Aplicações de IA confiáveis","IA verificável","Python para IA","Tutoriais de OpenGradient"],"ru":["OpenGradient","SDK Python","Верифицируемая инференция ИИ","Разработка ИИ","ИИ Агенты","Инструменты ИИ","Надежные приложения ИИ","ИИ верифицируемый","Python для ИИ","Уроки OpenGradient"],"ar":["OpenGradient","SDK بايثون","الاستدلال الذكي القابل للتحقق","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي موثوقة","الذكاء الاصطناعي القابل للتحقق","بايثون لذكاء اصطناعي","دروس OpenGradient"]}},"owner":"OpenGradient","repo":"OpenGradient-SDK","repoPath":"OpenGradient/OpenGradient-SDK","stars":80,"forks":13,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T02:25:10Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"opengradient","description":">","bodyPreview":"You are an expert on the **OpenGradient Python SDK** (`opengradient`). Help the user write correct, idiomatic code using the SDK.\n\nWhen the user describes what they want to build, generate working code that follows the patterns below. Always prefer the simplest approach that satisfies the requirements.\n\n## Key Reference Files\n\nWhen you need more detail, read these files from the project:\n\n- **Examples**: `examples/` folder (runnable scripts for every feature)\n- **Tutorials**: `tutorials/` folder","body":"You are an expert on the **OpenGradient Python SDK** (`opengradient`). Help the user write correct, idiomatic code using the SDK.\n\nWhen the user describes what they want to build, generate working code that follows the patterns below. Always prefer the simplest approach that satisfies the requirements.\n\n## Key Reference Files\n\nWhen you need more detail, read these files from the project:\n\n- **Examples**: `examples/` folder (runnable scripts for every feature)\n- **Tutorials**: `tutorials/` folder (step-by-step walkthroughs)\n- **Types & Enums**: `src/opengradient/types.py`\n- **Client API**: `src/opengradient/client/client.py`\n- **LLM API**: `src/opengradient/client/llm.py`\n- **Alpha API**: `src/opengradient/client/alpha.py`\n- **LangChain adapter**: `src/opengradient/agents/__init__.py`\n\nAlso read the detailed API reference bundled with this skill at `api-reference.md` in this skill''s directory.\n\n## SDK Overview\n\nOpenGradient is a decentralized AI inference platform. The SDK provides:\n\n- **Verified LLM inference** via TEE (Trusted Execution Environment)\n- **x402 payment settlement** on Base Sepolia (on-chain receipts)\n- **Multi-provider models** (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, xAI) through a unified API\n- **On-chain ONNX model inference** (alpha features)\n- **LangChain integration** for building agents\n- **Digital twins** chat\n\n## Initialization\n\n```python\nimport opengradient as og\n\nclient = og.init(\n    private_key=\"0x...\",          # Required: Base Sepolia key with OPG tokens\n    alpha_private_key=\"0x...\",    # Optional: OpenGradient testnet key\n    email=\"...\",                  # Optional: Model Hub auth\n    password=\"...\",               # Optional: Model Hub auth\n    twins_api_key=\"...\",          # Optional: Digital twins\n)\n```\n\nBefore the first LLM call, approve OPG token spending (idempotent):\n```python\nclient.llm.ensure_opg_approval(opg_amount=5)\n```\n\n## Available Models (`og.TEE_LLM`)\n\n| Provider   | Models |\n|------------|--------|\n| OpenAI     | `GPT_4_1_2025_04_14`, `O4_MINI`, `GPT_5`, `GPT_5_MINI`, `GPT_5_2` |\n| Anthropic  | `CLAUDE_SONNET_4_5`, `CLAUDE_SONNET_4_6`, `CLAUDE_HAIKU_4_5`, `CLAUDE_OPUS_4_5`, `CLAUDE_OPUS_4_6` |\n| Google     | `GEMINI_2_5_FLASH`, `GEMINI_2_5_PRO`, `GEMINI_2_5_FLASH_LITE`, `GEMINI_3_PRO`, `GEMINI_3_FLASH` |\n| xAI        | `GROK_4`, `GROK_4_FAST`, `GROK_4_1_FAST`, `GROK_4_1_FAST_NON_REASONING` |\n\n## Settlement Modes (`og.x402SettlementMode`)\n\n- `SETTLE` — Hashes only (maximum privacy)\n- `SETTLE_METADATA` — Full data on-chain (maximum transparency)\n- `SETTLE_BATCH` — Aggregated hashes (most cost-efficient, default)\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Basic Chat\n\n```python\nresult = client.llm.chat(\n    model=og.TEE_LLM.GEMINI_2_5_FLASH,\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello!\"}],\n    max_tokens=300,\n    temperature=0.0,\n)\nprint(result.chat_output[\"content\"])\n```\n\n### Streaming\n\n```python\nstream = client.llm.chat(\n    model=og.TEE_LLM.GPT_4_1_2025_04_14,\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Explain quantum computing\"}],\n    max_tokens=500,\n    stream=True,\n)\nfor chunk in stream:\n    if chunk.choices[0].delta.content:\n        print(chunk.choices[0].delta.content, end=\"\", flush=True)\n```\n\n### Tool Calling\n\n```python\ntools = [{\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n        \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n        \"description\": \"Get current weather\",\n        \"parameters\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\"city\": {\"type\": \"string\"}},\n            \"required\": [\"city\"],\n        },\n    },\n}]\n\nresult = client.llm.chat(\n    model=og.TEE_LLM.GPT_5,\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Weather in NYC?\"}],\n    tools=tools,\n    max_tokens=200,\n)\n\nif result.finish_reason == \"tool_calls\":\n    for tc in result.chat_output[\"tool_calls\"]:\n        print(f\"Call: {tc[''function''][''name'']}({tc[''function''][''arguments'']})\")\n```\n\n### Multi-Turn Tool Agent Loop\n\n```python\nmessages = [\n    {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant.\"},\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": user_query},\n]\n\nfor _ in range(max_iterations):\n    result = client.llm.chat(\n        model=og.TEE_LLM.GPT_5,\n        messages=messages,\n        tools=tools,\n        tool_choice=\"auto\",\n    )\n    if result.finish_reason == \"tool_calls\":\n        messages.append(result.chat_output)\n        for tc in result.chat_output[\"tool_calls\"]:\n            tool_result = execute_tool(tc[\"function\"][\"name\"], tc[\"function\"][\"arguments\"])\n            messages.append({\n                \"role\": \"tool\",\n                \"tool_call_id\": tc[\"id\"],\n                \"content\": tool_result,\n            })\n    else:\n        final_answer = result.chat_output[\"content\"]\n        break\n```\n\n### LangChain ReAct Agent\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_core.tools import tool\nfrom langgraph.prebuilt import create_react_agent\n\nllm = og.agents.langchain_adapter(\n    private_key=\"0x...\",\n    model_cid=og.TEE_LLM.GPT_4_1_2025_04_14,\n    max_tokens=300,\n)\n\n@tool\ndef lookup(query: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Look up information.\"\"\"\n    return \"result\"\n\nagent = create_react_agent(llm, [lookup])\nresult = agent.invoke({\"messages\": [(\"user\", \"Find info about X\")]})\nprint(result[\"messages\"][-1].content)\n```\n\n### On-Chain ONNX Inference (Alpha)\n\n```python\nresult = client.alpha.infer(\n    model_cid=\"QmbUqS93oc4JTLMHwpVxsE39mhNxy6hpf6Py3r9oANr8aZ\",\n    inference_mode=og.InferenceMode.VANILLA,\n    model_input={\"input\": [1.0, 2.0, 3.0]},\n)\nprint(result.model_output)\nprint(result.transaction_hash)\n```\n\n### Digital Twins\n\n```python\nclient = og.init(private_key=\"0x...\", twins_api_key=\"your-key\")\n\nresult = client.twins.chat(\n    twin_id=\"0x1abd463fd6244be4a1dc0f69e0b70cd5\",\n    model=og.TEE_LLM.GROK_4_1_FAST_NON_REASONING,\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What do you think about AI?\"}],\n    max_tokens=1000,\n)\nprint(result.chat_output[\"content\"])\n```\n\n### Model Hub: Upload a Model\n\n```python\nrepo = client.model_hub.create_model(\n    model_name=\"my-model\",\n    model_desc=\"A prediction model\",\n    version=\"1.0.0\",\n)\nupload = client.model_hub.upload(\n    model_name=repo.name,\n    version=repo.initialVersion,\n    model_path=\"./model.onnx\",\n)\nprint(f\"Model CID: {upload.modelCid}\")\n```\n\n## Return Types\n\n- **`TextGenerationOutput`**: `chat_output` (dict), `finish_reason`, `transaction_hash`, `payment_hash`\n- **`TextGenerationStream`**: iterable of `StreamChunk` objects\n- **`StreamChunk`**: `choices[0].delta.content`, `choices[0].delta.tool_calls`, `usage` (final only), `is_final`\n- **`InferenceResult`**: `model_output` (dict of np.ndarray), `transaction_hash`\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. Always call `client.llm.ensure_opg_approval()` before the first LLM inference.\n2. Handle `finish_reason`: `\"stop\"` / `\"length\"` = text response, `\"tool_calls\"` = function calls.\n3. For streaming, check `chunk.choices[0].delta.content` is not None before printing.\n4. In tool-calling loops, append `result.chat_output` as the assistant message, then append each tool result with `role: \"tool\"` and matching `tool_call_id`.\n5. Use environment variables or config files for private keys — never hardcode them.\n6. If you are unsure about a specific API detail, read the source files listed above.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:33:24.737Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing verifiable AI inference and comprehensive content analysis with OpenGradient","zh":"适合需要可验证 AI 推理和使用 OpenGradient 进行全面内容分析的 AI 代理","ja":"OpenGradient を使用した検証可能な AI 推論と包括的なコンテンツ分析を必要とする AI エージェントに適しています","ko":"OpenGradient를 사용한 검증 가능한 AI 추론 및 종합적인 콘텐츠 분석이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan inferencia de IA verificable y análisis de contenido integral con OpenGradient","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une inférence d''IA vérifiable et d''une analyse de contenu complète avec OpenGradient","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten, die verifizierbare KI-Schlussfolgerung und umfassende Inhaltsanalyse mit OpenGradient benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de inferência de IA verificável e análise de conteúdo abrangente com OpenGradient","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым необходима верифицируемая ИИ-инференция и всесторонний анализ контента с OpenGradient","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى استدلال إيه إيه موثوق بها وتحليل محتوى شامل مع OpenGradient"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build correct and idiomatic code using the OpenGradient Python SDK, providing verifiable AI inference and benefiting from comprehensive content analysis, with features such as Python SDK and access to tutorials and examples","zh":"赋予代理构建正确且惯用的代码的能力，使用 OpenGradient Python SDK 提供可验证的 AI 推理，并从全面内容分析中受益，包括提供 Python SDK 和访问教程及示例等功能","ja":"OpenGradient Python SDK を使用して正確で慣用的コードを構築する機能をエージェントに与え、検証可能な AI 推論を提供し、包括的なコンテンツ分析の利点を活用し、Python SDK の提供やチュートリアルおよび例へのアクセスなどの機能を備えています","ko":"OpenGradient Python SDK를 사용하여 올바르고 관용적인 코드를 구축할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하여 검증 가능한 AI 추론을 제공하고, 종합적인 콘텐츠 분석의 이점을 활용하며, Python SDK 제공 및 튜토리얼 및 예제에 대한 액세스 등의 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes crear código correcto e idiomático utilizando el SDK de Python de OpenGradient, proporcionando inferencia de IA verificable y beneficiándose de un análisis de contenido integral, con características como el SDK de Python y acceso a tutoriales y ejemplos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un code correct et idiomatique en utilisant le SDK Python OpenGradient, offrant une inférence d''IA vérifiable et bénéficiant d''une analyse de contenu complète, avec des fonctionnalités telles que le SDK Python et l''accès à des tutoriels et des exemples","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, korrekten und idiomatischen Code mithilfe des OpenGradient Python SDK zu erstellen, verifizierbare KI-Schlussfolgerung bereitzustellen und von einer umfassenden Inhaltsanalyse zu profitieren, mit Funktionen wie dem Python SDK und Zugriff auf Tutorien und Beispiele","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir código correto e idiomático usando o SDK Python OpenGradient, fornecendo inferência de IA verificável e se beneficiando de análise de conteúdo abrangente, com recursos como SDK Python e acesso a tutoriais e exemplos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать правильный и идиоматически