n aus Code","pt":"O que é documentação? É um fluxo de trabalho para gerar documentação de código e projetos","ru":"Что такое документация? Это поток работы для генерации документации кода и проектов","ar":"ما هي الوثائق؟ وهي تدفق عمل لإنشاء وثائق للرمز البرمجي والمشاريع"},"features":{"en":["Generates API documentation from codebases","Creates architecture documentation for project overview","Supports generation of README files and code comments","Enables creation of user guides and maintenance of wikis","Includes documentation planning phase for workflow optimization"],"zh":["支持API文档生成","支持架构文档生成","支持README文件生成","支持代码注释生成","支持技术文档生成"],"ja":["APIドキュメント生成をサポート","建築ドキュメント生成をサポート","READMEファイル生成をサポート","コードコメント生成をサポート","テクニカルコンテンツ生成をサポート"],"ko":["API 문서 생성 지원","아키텍처 문서 생성 지원","README 파일 생성 지원","코드 주석 생성 지원","기술 문서 생성 지원"],"es":["Generación de documentación de API","Creación de documentación de arquitectura","Generación de archivos README","Creación de comentarios de código","Mantenimiento de wikis"],"fr":["Génération de documentation d''API","Création de documentation d''architecture","Génération de fichiers README","Création de commentaires de code","Maintenance de wikis"],"de":["Generierung von API-Dokumentation","Erstellung von Architektur-Dokumentation","Generierung von README-Dateien","Erstellung von Code-Kommentaren","Wartung von Wikis"],"pt":["Geração de documentação de API","Criação de arquivos README","Documentação de código","Geração de guias de usuário","Manutenção de wikis"],"ru":["Генерация документации API","Создание файлов README","Документация кода","Генерация руководств пользователя","Ведение вики"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق API","خلق ملفات README","توثيق الرمز البرمجي","إنشاء دليل المستخدم","صيانة الوiki"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use documentation workflow","what is documentation in software development","documentation workflow bundle alternative","documentation vs readme files","documentation setup guide for AI agents","documentation install for Solana projects"],"zh":["文档工作流","Decentralized Pawn Shop 协议","Defi 文档","API 文档生成","架构文档生成","代码注释生成","技术文档生成"],"ja":["ドキュメントワークフロー","AIエージェント","Defiドキュメント","APIドキュメント生成","建築ドキュメント生成","コードコメント生成","テクニカルコンテンツ生成"],"ko":["문서 작업 흐름","AI 에이전트","Defi 문서","API 문서 생성","아키텍처 문서 생성","코드 주석 생성","기술 문서 생성"],"es":["documentación de API","desarrollo de software","documentación técnica","flujos de trabajo de documentación","Generación de documentación","herramientas de documentación"],"fr":["documentation d''API","développement de logiciels","documentation technique","flux de travail de documentation","Génération de documentation","outils de documentation"],"de":["API-Dokumentation","Software-Entwicklung","technische Dokumentation","Dokumentations-Workflows","Generierung von Dokumentation","Dokumentations-Tools"],"pt":["documentação de API","fluxo de trabalho de documentação","geração de documentação","desenvolvimento de software","protocolo Decentralized Pawn Shop","Solana","Anchor"],"ru":["документация API","поток документации","генерация документации","разработка программного обеспечения","децентрализованный протокол ломбарда","Solana","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["وثائق API","تدفق الوثائق","إنشاء الوثائق","تطوير البرمجيات","بروتوكول رهن الديцентрализي","سولانا","عاملات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Dr-SoloDev","repo":"ginva","repoPath":"Dr-SoloDev/ginva","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T21:30:41Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"documentation","description":"Documentation generation workflow covering API docs, architecture docs, README files, code comments, and technical writing.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Documentation Workflow Bundle\n\n## Overview\n\nComprehensive documentation workflow for generating API documentation, architecture documentation, README files, code comments, and technical content from codebases.\n\n## When to Use This Workflow\n\nUse this workflow when:\n- Creating project documentation\n- Generating API documentation\n- Writing architecture docs\n- Documenting code\n- Creating user guides\n- Maintaining wikis\n\n## Workflow Phases\n\n### Phase 1: Documentation Planning\n\n#### Skills to Invoke","body":"# Documentation Workflow Bundle\n\n## Overview\n\nComprehensive documentation workflow for generating API documentation, architecture documentation, README files, code comments, and technical content from codebases.\n\n## When to Use This Workflow\n\nUse this workflow when:\n- Creating project documentation\n- Generating API documentation\n- Writing architecture docs\n- Documenting code\n- Creating user guides\n- Maintaining wikis\n\n## Workflow Phases\n\n### Phase 1: Documentation Planning\n\n#### Skills to Invoke\n- `docs-architect` - Documentation architecture\n- `documentation-templates` - Documentation templates\n\n#### Actions\n1. Identify documentation needs\n2. Choose documentation tools\n3. Plan documentation structure\n4. Define style guidelines\n5. Set up documentation site\n\n#### Copy-Paste Prompts\n```\nUse @docs-architect to plan documentation structure\n```\n\n```\nUse @documentation-templates to set up documentation\n```\n\n### Phase 2: API Documentation\n\n#### Skills to Invoke\n- `api-documenter` - API documentation\n- `api-documentation-generator` - Auto-generation\n- `openapi-spec-generation` - OpenAPI specs\n\n#### Actions\n1. Extract API endpoints\n2. Generate OpenAPI specs\n3. Create API reference\n4. Add usage examples\n5. Set up auto-generation\n\n#### Copy-Paste Prompts\n```\nUse @api-documenter to generate API documentation\n```\n\n```\nUse @openapi-spec-generation to create OpenAPI specs\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Architecture Documentation\n\n#### Skills to Invoke\n- `c4-architecture-c4-architecture` - C4 architecture\n- `c4-context` - Context diagrams\n- `c4-container` - Container diagrams\n- `c4-component` - Component diagrams\n- `c4-code` - Code diagrams\n- `mermaid-expert` - Mermaid diagrams\n\n#### Actions\n1. Create C4 diagrams\n2. Document architecture\n3. Generate sequence diagrams\n4. Document data flows\n5. Create deployment docs\n\n#### Copy-Paste Prompts\n```\nUse @c4-architecture-c4-architecture to create C4 diagrams\n```\n\n```\nUse @mermaid-expert to create architecture diagrams\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Code Documentation\n\n#### Skills to Invoke\n- `code-documentation-code-explain` - Code explanation\n- `code-documentation-doc-generate` - Doc generation\n- `documentation-generation-doc-generate` - Auto-generation\n\n#### Actions\n1. Extract code comments\n2. Generate JSDoc/TSDoc\n3. Create type documentation\n4. Document functions\n5. Add usage examples\n\n#### Copy-Paste Prompts\n```\nUse @code-documentation-code-explain to explain code\n```\n\n```\nUse @code-documentation-doc-generate to generate docs\n```\n\n### Phase 5: README and Getting Started\n\n#### Skills to Invoke\n- `readme` - README generation\n- `environment-setup-guide` - Setup guides\n- `tutorial-engineer` - Tutorial creation\n\n#### Actions\n1. Create README\n2. Write getting started guide\n3. Document installation\n4. Add usage examples\n5. Create troubleshooting guide\n\n#### Copy-Paste Prompts\n```\nUse @readme to create project README\n```\n\n```\nUse @tutorial-engineer to create tutorials\n```\n\n### Phase 6: Wiki and Knowledge Base\n\n#### Skills to Invoke\n- `wiki-architect` - Wiki architecture\n- `wiki-page-writer` - Wiki pages\n- `wiki-onboarding` - Onboarding docs\n- `wiki-qa` - Wiki Q&A\n- `wiki-researcher` - Wiki research\n- `wiki-vitepress` - VitePress wiki\n\n#### Actions\n1. Design wiki structure\n2. Create wiki pages\n3. Write onboarding guides\n4. Document processes\n5. Set up wiki site\n\n#### Copy-Paste Prompts\n```\nUse @wiki-architect to design wiki structure\n```\n\n```\nUse @wiki-page-writer to create wiki pages\n```\n\n```\nUse @wiki-onboarding to create onboarding docs\n```\n\n### Phase 7: Changelog and Release Notes\n\n#### Skills to Invoke\n- `changelog-automation` - Changelog generation\n- `wiki-changelog` - Changelog from git\n\n#### Actions\n1. Extract commit history\n2. Categorize changes\n3. Generate changelog\n4. Create release notes\n5. Publish updates\n\n#### Copy-Paste Prompts\n```\nUse @changelog-automation to generate changelog\n```\n\n```\nUse @wiki-changelog to create release notes\n```\n\n### Phase 8: Documentation Maintenance\n\n#### Skills to Invoke\n- `doc-coauthoring` - Collaborative writing\n- `reference-builder` - Reference docs\n\n#### Actions\n1. Review documentation\n2. Update outdated content\n3. Fix broken links\n4. Add new features\n5. Gather feedback\n\n#### Copy-Paste Prompts\n```\nUse @doc-coauthoring to collaborate on docs\n```\n\n## Documentation Types\n\n### Code-Level\n- JSDoc/TSDoc comments\n- Function documentation\n- Type definitions\n- Example code\n\n### API Documentation\n- Endpoint reference\n- Request/response schemas\n- Authentication guides\n- SDK documentation\n\n### Architecture Documentation\n- System overview\n- Component diagrams\n- Data flow diagrams\n- Deployment architecture\n\n### User Documentation\n- Getting started guides\n- User manuals\n- Tutorials\n- FAQs\n\n### Process Documentation\n- Runbooks\n- Onboarding guides\n- SOPs\n- Decision records\n\n## Quality Gates\n\n- [ ] All APIs documented\n- [ ] Architecture diagrams current\n- [ ] README up to date\n- [ ] Code comments helpful\n- [ ] Examples working\n- [ ] Links valid\n\n## Related Workflow Bundles\n\n- `development` - Development workflow\n- `testing-qa` - Documentation testing\n- `ai-ml` - AI documentation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:07:41.845Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing automated technical content generation for API documentation, architecture documentation, and codebases.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化技术内容生成的开发人员代理，包括API文档、架构文档和代码库。","ja":"APIドキュメント、アーキテクチャドキュメント、コードベースの自動化されたテクニカルコンテンツ生成が必要な開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"API 문서, 아키텍처 문서 및 코드베이스에 대한 자동화된 기술 콘텐츠 생성이 필요한 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan generación automática de contenido técnico para documentación de API, documentación de arquitectura y códigos base.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin de génération automatique de contenu technique pour la documentation d''API, la documentation d''architecture et les bases de code.","de":"Perfekt für Developer Agents, die automatisierte technische Inhaltsgenerierung für API-Dokumentation, Architekturdokumentation und Codebasen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que precisam de geração automática de conteúdo técnico para documentação de API, documentação de arquitetura e codebases.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация технического контента для документации API, документации архитектуры и кодовых баз.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يحتاج إلى توليد المحتوى الفني الآلي لتوثيق API ووثائق الهندسة المعمارية وقواعد الكود."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive technical content from codebases, including API documentation, architecture docs, README files, and code comments, using protocols like API documentation generation and file formats like Markdown.","zh":"赋予代理生成代码库的综合技术内容的能力，包括API文档、架构文档、README文件和代码注释，使用API文档生成和Markdown等协议和文件格式。","ja":"エージェントがコードベースから包括的なテクニカルコンテンツを生成する能力を与えます。APIドキュメント、 アーキテクチャドキュメント、 READMEファイル、 コードコメントなどを、 APIドキュメント生成やMarkdownなどのプロトコルやファイル形式を使用して生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 코드베이스에서 포괄적인 기술 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. API 문서, 아키텍처 문서, README 파일, 코드 주석 등과 같은 것을 API 문서 생성 및 Markdown와 같은 프로토콜 및 파일 형식을 사용하여 생성합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para generar contenido técnico integral desde códigos base, incluyendo documentación de API, documentación de arquitectura, archivos README y comentarios de código, utilizando protocolos como la generación de documentación de API y formatos de archivo como Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer un contenu technique complet à partir de bases de code, y compris la documentation d''API, la documentation d''architecture, les fichiers README et les commentaires de code, en utilisant des protocoles tels que la génération de documentation d''API et des formats de fichier tels que Markdown.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassenden technischen Inhalt aus Codebasen zu generieren, einschließlich API-Dokumentation, Architekturdokumentation, README-Dateien und Codekommentare, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie API-Dokumentenerstellung und Dateiformaten wie Markdown.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem conteúdo técnico abrangente a partir de codebases, incluindo documentação de API, documentação de arquitetura, arquivos README e comentários de código, usando protocolos como geração de documentação de API e formatos de arquivo como Markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полный технический контент из кодовых баз, включая документацию API, документацию архитектуры, файлы README и комментарии кода, используя протоколы, такие как генерация документации API, и форматы файлов, такие как Markdown.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل توليد محتوى فني شامل من قواعد الكود ، بما في ذلك توثيق API ووثائق الهندسة المعمارية وملفات README وتعليقات الكود ، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل توليد توثيق API وأشكال الملفات مثل Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating API documentation generation","Creating architecture documentation from code","Generating README files for projects","Documenting codebases for maintainers"],"zh":["自动化API文档生成","从代码创建架构文档","为项目生成README文件","为维护者记录代码库"],"ja":["APIドキュメントの自動生成","コードからアーキテクチャドキュメントを作成","プロジェクトのREADMEファイルを生成","メンテナ向けのコードベースのドキュメント化"],"ko":["API 문서 자동 생성","코드에서 아키텍처 문서 생성","프로젝트 README 파일 생성","유지 관리자를 위한 코드베이스 문서화"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de documentación de API","Creación de documentación de arquitectura a partir de código","Generación de archivos README para proyectos","Documentación de códigos base para los responsables de mantenimiento"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de documentation d''API","Création de documentation d''architecture à partir de code","Génération de fichiers README pour les projets","Documentation de bases de code pour les responsables de maintenance"],"de":["Automatisierung der API-Dokumentenerstellung","Erstellung von Architekturdokumentation aus Code","Generierung von README-Dateien für Projekte","Dokumentation von Codebasen für Wartungsverantwortliche"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de documentação de API","Criar documentação de arquitetura a partir do código","Gerar arquivos README para projetos","Documentar codebases para mantenedores"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию документации API","Создавать документацию архитектуры из кода","Генерировать файлы README для проектов","Документировать кодовые базы для поддерживающих"],"ar":["أتمتة توليد توثيق API","إنشاء وثائق الهندسة المعمارية من الكود","توليد ملفات README للمشاريع","توثيق قواعد الكود للمحافظين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to codebases","Limited to generating technical content","May require additional configuration for custom documentation workflows"],"zh":["需要访问代码库","仅限生成技术内容","可能需要额外配置自定义文档工作流"],"ja":["コードベースへのアクセスが必要","テクニカルコンテンツの生成に限定","カスタムドキュメントワークフローには追加の設定が必要な場合がある"],"ko":["코드베이스에 접근할 수 있어야 함","기술 콘텐츠 생성에 제한됨","사용자 지정 문서 워크플로에 대해 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a códigos base","Limitado a la generación de contenido técnico","Puede requerir configuración adicional para flujos de trabajo de documentación personalizados"],"fr":["Requiert l''accès aux bases de code","Limité à la génération de contenu technique","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour les flux de travail de documentation personnalisés"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Codebasen","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von technischem Inhalt","Kann zusätzliche Konfiguration für benutzerdefinierte Dokumentationsworkflows erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso a codebases","Limitado a gerar conteúdo técnico","Pode requerer configuração adicional para fluxos de trabalho personalizados de documentação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовым базам","Ограничен генерацией технического контента","Может требовать дополнительной настройки для пользовательских рабочих процессов документации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قواعد الكود","محدود بتوليد المحتوى الفني","يمكن أن يتطلب 구성ًا إضافيًا لتدفقات العمل المخصصة لتوثيق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5c9ada2648589ccd15ab8f8beff62ac2cc20ec32d0535c9ade89342357e49cf3","qualityScore":65}');
