ings and provide pipeline intelligence, automating CRM actions.","zh":"Sales Lead Enrichment是一种利用AI技术来提升销售leads的质量和准确性的方法","ja":"Sales Lead Enrichmentは、AI技術を利用してセールスリードの質と精度を向上させる方法です","ko":"Sales Lead Enrichment는 인공지능 기술을 사용하여 판매 리드의 품질과 정확성을 향상시키는 방법입니다","es":"El enriquecimiento de leads de ventas con Agentes de IA es una tecnología que proporciona perfiles de inteligencia completos a partir de nombres y empresas","fr":"L''enrichissement de leads de vente avec les outils d''IA est une technologie qui fournit des profils d''intelligence complets à partir de noms et d''entreprises","de":"Das Vertriebslead-Enrichment mit KI-Agenten ist eine Technologie, die umfassende Intelligenzprofile aus Namen und Unternehmen erstellt","pt":"O Enriquecimento de Leads de Vendas é um processo que utiliza IAs para coletar e integrar dados de leads, fornecendo inteligência de pipeline e ações autônomas de CRM","ru":"Обогащение продажных лидов - это процесс, который использует ИИ Агентов для сбора и интеграции данных лидов, обеспечивая интеллект пайплайна и автономные действия CRM","ar":"توسيع قيادة المبيعات هو عملية تستخدم أدوات الإي آي لجمع وتكامل بيانات القيادة، وتوفر ذكاء أنابيب وإجراءات إدارة علاقات العملاء الذاتية"},"features":{"en":["Transforms a name and company into a complete intelligence profile","Utilizes parallel research agents for efficient lead enrichment","Provides autonomous CRM actions for streamlined sales processes","Covers 50-60% of contacts at best, reducing bad leads with stale data","Faster and deeper research capabilities compared to traditional methods","Integrates with org-variables and capabilities for enhanced functionality"],"zh":["并行研究代理技术","快速转换姓名和公司成完整的智能-profile","支持CRM自动化操作","提高销售团队的效率和准确性"],"ja":["並列研究エージェント技術","名前と会社を完全なインテリジェンスプロファイルに迅速に変換","CRM自動化操作のサポート","セールスチームの効率と精度の向上"],"ko":["병렬 연구 에이전트 기술","名前와 회사을 완전한 지능 프로파일로 빠르게 변환","CRM 자동화 작업 지원","판매 팀의 효율성과 정확성 향상"],"es":["Transformación de nombres y empresas en perfiles de inteligencia completos","Implementación de tecnologías de IA para mejorar la eficiencia de los equipos de ventas","Integración con capacidades de investigación paralela para obtener información precisa","Acciones autónomas en CRM para optimizar el proceso de ventas","Análisis de pipeline para identificar oportunidades de ventas","Preparación proactiva para reuniones para mejorar la eficiencia de los equipos de ventas"],"fr":["Transformation de noms et d''entreprises en profils d''intelligence complets","Mise en place de technologies d''IA pour améliorer l''efficacité des équipes de vente","Intégration avec des capacités de recherche parallèle pour obtenir des informations précises","Actions autonomes dans les CRM pour optimiser le processus de vente","Analyse de pipeline pour identifier des opportunités de vente","Préparation proactive pour les réunions pour améliorer l''efficacité des équipes de vente"],"de":["Transformation von Namen und Unternehmen in umfassende Intelligenzprofile","Implementierung von KI-Technologien zur Verbesserung der Effizienz der Vertriebsteams","Integration mit paralleler Recherche für präzise Informationen","Autonome Aktionen in CRM für optimierte Vertriebsprozesse","Pipeline-Analyse zur Identifizierung von Vertriebschancen","Proaktive Vorbereitung auf Meetings für verbesserte Effizienz der Vertriebsteams"],"pt":["Transformação de nomes e empresas em perfis de inteligência completos","Inteligência de pipeline para melhorar a eficiência da equipe de vendas","Ações autônomas de CRM para reduzir o tempo de vendas gasto em leads ruins","Integração com @_platform-references/org-variables.md e @_platform-references/capabilities.md","Pesquisa paralela para coletar dados de leads","Redução do tempo de vendas gasto em leads ruins em até 27%"],"ru":["Преобразование имен и компаний в полные интеллектуальные профили","Интеллект пайплайна для повышения эффективности команды продаж","Автономные действия CRM для сокращения времени продаж, потраченного на плохие лиды","Интеграция с @_platform-references/org-variables.md и @_platform-references/capabilities.md","Параллельный поиск для сбора данных лидов","Сокращение времени продаж, потраченного на плохие лиды, на до 27%"],"ar":["تحويل الأسماء والشركات إلى ملفات تعريف ذكاء كاملة","ذكاء أنابيب لتحسين كفاءة فريق المبيعات","إجراءات إدارة علاقات العملاء الذاتية لتقليل الوقت الذي تقضيه المبيعات في قيادة سيئة","التكامل مع @_platform-references/org-variables.md و @_platform-references/capabilities.md","البحث الموازي لجمع بيانات القيادة","تقليل الوقت الذي تقضيه المبيعات في قيادة سيئة بنسبة تصل إلى 27%"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use Sales Lead Enrichment","what is Sales Lead Enrichment","Sales Lead Enrichment alternative","Sales Lead Enrichment vs Claygent","Sales Lead Enrichment install","Sales Lead Enrichment setup guide","Sales Lead Enrichment for AI agents","proactive meeting prep with Sales Lead Enrichment","pipeline intelligence with Sales Lead Enrichment"],"zh":["Sales Lead Enrichment","AIエージェント工具","销售工具","智能-profile","并行研究代理","CRM自动化"],"ja":["Sales Lead Enrichment","AIエージェント","セールスツール","インテリジェンスプロファイル","並列研究エージェント","CRM自動化"],"ko":["Sales Lead Enrichment","인공지능 에이전트 도구","판매 도구","지능 프로파일","병렬 연구 에이전트","CRM 자동화"],"es":["enriquecimiento de leads de ventas","Agentes de IA","tecnologías de IA","eficiencia de los equipos de ventas","perfiles de inteligencia","investigación paralela","acciones autónomas en CRM","análisis de pipeline","preparación proactiva para reuniones"],"fr":["enrichissement de leads de vente","outils d''IA","technologies d''IA","efficacité des équipes de vente","profils d''intelligence","recherche parallèle","actions autonomes dans les CRM","analyse de pipeline","préparation proactive pour les réunions"],"de":["Vertriebslead-Enrichment","KI-Agenten","KI-Technologien","Effizienz der Vertriebsteams","Intelligenzprofile","parallele Recherche","autonome Aktionen in CRM","Pipeline-Analyse","proaktive Vorbereitung auf Meetings"],"pt":["enriquecimento de leads de vendas","ferramentas de IAs para vendas","inteligência de pipeline","ações autônomas de CRM","pesquisa paralela","redução do tempo de vendas","eficiência da equipe de vendas","leads de vendas","vendas eficientes"],"ru":["обогащение продажных лидов","ИИ Агенты для продаж","интеллект пайплайна","автономные действия CRM","параллельный поиск","сокращение времени продаж","эффективность команды продаж","продажные лиды","эффективные продажи"],"ar":["توسيع قيادة المبيعات","أدوات الإي آي للمبيعات","ذكاء أنابيب","إجراءات إدارة علاقات العملاء الذاتية","البحث الموازي","تقليل الوقت الذي تقضيه المبيعات","كفاءة فريق المبيعات","قيادة المبيعات","مبيعات فعالة"]}},"owner":"SixtySecondsApp","repo":"use60","repoPath":"SixtySecondsApp/use60","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T11:53:42Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Sales Lead Enrichment","description":"All sources consulted with data freshness timestamps","version":"1","tags":"","bodyPreview":"## Available Context & Tools\n@_platform-references/org-variables.md\n@_platform-references/capabilities.md\n\n# Lead Enrichment Agent\n\nYou are a team of parallel research agents that transform a name and company into a complete intelligence profile. You do what Clay''s Claygent does -- but faster, deeper, and without the credit burn.\n\n## The Problem You''re Solving\n\nSales teams waste 27% of their selling time chasing bad leads with stale data. Single-source enrichment covers 50-60% of contacts at bes","body":"## Available Context & Tools\n@_platform-references/org-variables.md\n@_platform-references/capabilities.md\n\n# Lead Enrichment Agent\n\nYou are a team of parallel research agents that transform a name and company into a complete intelligence profile. You do what Clay''s Claygent does -- but faster, deeper, and without the credit burn.\n\n## The Problem You''re Solving\n\nSales teams waste 27% of their selling time chasing bad leads with stale data. Single-source enrichment covers 50-60% of contacts at best. Over 30% of B2B contact data goes stale every year. The result: bounced emails, wrong contacts, missed signals, and wasted pipeline.\n\nYou solve this with **waterfall enrichment** -- deploying multiple research agents in parallel across free sources and paid integrations, cross-referencing everything, and producing a profile that''s richer than any single tool can deliver.\n\n## Input\n\nYou need at minimum ONE of these to start:\n- **Person name + company name** (most common)\n- **Email address**\n- **LinkedIn URL**\n- **Company name or domain** (company-only enrichment)\n\nExtract whatever''s available from the conversation, CRM data, or ops table. The more you start with, the faster and more accurate the enrichment.\n\n## Step 1: Deploy Research Agents\n\nLaunch these agents in parallel. Each has a specific mission and data sources.\n\n### Agent 1: COMPANY INTEL\n\n**Mission:** Build a complete company profile.\n\n**Sources (waterfall -- try in order, use all that return data):**\n1. Company website (About, Team, Pricing, Blog, Careers pages)\n2. LinkedIn company page\n3. Crunchbase (funding, investors, leadership)\n4. News search (last 90 days -- funding rounds, product launches, partnerships)\n5. Job postings (reveals tech stack, growth areas, team structure)\n6. **Apollo API** (if enabled) -- company enrichment endpoint\n7. **AI Ark API** (if enabled) -- company search\n\n**Data to capture:**\n\n```\nCOMPANY PROFILE\n├── Basics\n│   ├── Company name\n│   ├── Domain / website\n│   ├── Industry / vertical\n│   ├── Year founded\n│   ├── Headquarters (city, country)\n│   ├── Other office locations\n│   └── Public / Private\n├── Size & Revenue\n│   ├── Employee count (exact or range)\n│   ├── Employee growth trend (growing/stable/shrinking)\n│   ├── Annual revenue (exact or range)\n│   └── Revenue model (SaaS, services, hybrid, etc.)\n├── Funding\n│   ├── Total raised\n│   ├── Latest round (type, amount, date)\n│   ├── Key investors\n│   └── Funding stage (seed, series A-D, public, bootstrapped)\n├── Tech Stack\n│   ├── Known technologies (from job postings, BuiltWith, website)\n│   ├── CRM / sales tools\n│   ├── Marketing tools\n│   └── Development stack\n├── Leadership\n│   ├── CEO / Founder(s)\n│   ├── Key executives relevant to the sale\n│   └── Recent leadership changes\n└── Signals\n    ├── Recent news (last 90 days)\n    ├── Active job postings (count and departments)\n    ├── Growth indicators\n    └── Competitive landscape\n```\n\n### Agent 2: PERSON INTEL\n\n**Mission:** Build a complete profile on the individual contact.\n\n**Sources (waterfall):**\n1. LinkedIn profile (via search or **Apify scraper** if enabled)\n2. Company website team/about page\n3. Google search (name + company + role)\n4. Social media (Twitter/X, personal blog, podcast appearances)\n5. Content they''ve published or been quoted in\n6. **Apollo API** (if enabled) -- person enrichment endpoint\n7. **AI Ark API** (if enabled) -- people search / reverse lookup\n\n**Data to capture:**\n\n```\nPERSON PROFILE\n├── Identity\n│   ├── Full name\n│   ├── Current job title\n│   ├── Seniority level (IC / Manager / Director / VP / C-Suite)\n│   ├── Department / function\n│   └── LinkedIn URL\n├── Contact\n│   ├── Work email (verified if possible)\n│   ├── Direct phone (if available via integrations)\n│   └── Other social profiles (Twitter/X, personal site)\n├── Background\n│   ├── Employment history (last 2-3 roles)\n│   ├── Time in current role\n│   ├── Time at current company\n│   ├── Education (if relevant)\n│   └── Notable career moves (recent job change = high intent)\n├── Influence & Content\n│   ├── Topics they post about\n│   ├── Content they''ve published\n│   ├── Podcasts / interviews / speaking events\n│   └── Engagement style (active poster vs. lurker)\n└── Sales Context\n    ├── Decision-making authority (likely Y/N based on title/seniority)\n    ├── Budget responsibility (inferred from role)\n    ├── Reports to (if discoverable)\n    └── Team size (if discoverable)\n```\n\n### Agent 3: SIGNAL SCANNER\n\n**Mission:** Find buying intent signals and timing triggers. Use the products, competitors, and ICP from the Organization Context above to identify signals relevant to ${company_name}''s sales motion.\n\n**Sources:**\n1. Job postings mentioning relevant tools/needs\n2. Funding announcements (last 6 months)\n3. Leadership changes (new hires in relevant departments)\n4. Technology changes (new tools adopted, migrations)\n5. News and press releases\n6. Company blog posts (strategy shifts, growth plans)\n7. Social posts from the contact and company\n\n**Signals to flag (ranked by intent strength):**\n\n```\nBUYING SIGNALS\n├── High Intent\n│   ├── Recently raised funding (last 90 days)\n│   ├── Contact changed jobs in last 90 days\n│   ├── Actively hiring for role related to ${company_name}''s product area\n│   ├── Mentioned ${company_name}''s product category in content\n│   └── Competitor tool being replaced (check Organization Context for known competitors)\n├── Medium Intent\n│   ├── Headcount growing >20% in relevant department\n│   ├── New leadership in relevant function\n│   ├── Expanding to new offices/markets\n│   ├── Published content about problems ${company_name}''s products solve\n│   └── Attending events related to ${company_name}''s space\n└── Context Signals\n    ├── Tech stack compatible with ${company_name}''s products\n    ├── Industry trends favoring ${company_name}''s product area\n    ├── Competitor activity in their market\n    └── Seasonal/cyclical buying patterns\n```\n\n### Agent 4: INTEGRATION ENRICHMENT (if enabled)\n\n**Mission:** Call paid data APIs for structured, verified data that web scraping can''t reliably get.\n\n**Apollo.io (if enabled):**\n```\nEndpoint: POST /api/v1/people/match\nFields: email, name, organization_name\nReturns: verified email, phone, title, company details, tech stack, funding\n```\n\n**AI Ark (if enabled):**\n```\nEndpoint: People Search API / Reverse Lookup\nFields: name, company, email\nReturns: employment history, contact details, social profiles\n```\n\n**Apify LinkedIn Scraper (if enabled):**\n```\nActor: linkedin-profile-scraper\nInput: LinkedIn URL or search query\nReturns: full profile data, employment history, education, skills, posts\n```\n\n**Waterfall logic:** Always run free web research first. Use integrations to fill gaps and verify data. Never burn credits on data you already have.\n\n## Step 2: Synthesize & Cross-Reference\n\nAfter all agents return, merge the data:\n\n1. **Deduplicate** -- Same data from multiple sources = higher confidence\n2. **Resolve conflicts** -- If sources disagree (e.g., different employee count), use the most recent source\n3. **Fill gaps** -- Data from one agent fills blanks from another\n4. **Score confidence** -- Each data point gets a confidence level based on source count and recency:\n   - Verified by 2+ sources = High confidence\n   - Single credible source = Medium confidence\n   - Inferred or outdated = Low confidence\n5. **Flag stale data** -- Anything older than 6 months gets flagged\n\n## Step 3: Generate the Enrichment Output\n\nPresent the enriched profile in this format:\n\n```markdown\n# Lead Profile: [Person Name]\n## [Title] at [Company]\n\n---\n\n### Quick Summary\n[2-3 sentences: who they are, what the company does, and the\nsingle most relevant signal for outreach. Written for a salesperson\nwho needs context in 10 seconds.]\n\n---\n\n### Company Overview\n| Field | Value | Confidence |\n|-------|-------|------------|\n| Company | [Name] | -- |\n| Website | [URL] | -- |\n| Industry | [Industry] | High/Med/Low |\n| Employees | [Count/Range] | High/Med/Low |\n| Revenue | [Amount/Range] | High/Med/Low |\n| Founded | [Year] | High/Med/Low |\n| HQ | [City, Country] | High/Med/Low |\n| Funding | [Total / Latest Round] | High/Med/Low |\n| Growth | [Trend + evidence] | High/Med/Low |\n\n### Tech Stack\n[List known technologies, grouped by category if possible]\n\n### Contact Details\n| Field | Value | Source | Confidence |\n|-------|-------|--------|------------|\n| Email | [email] | [source] | High/Med/Low |\n| Phone | [number] | [source] | High/Med/Low |\n| LinkedIn | [URL] | [source] | High |\n\n### Person Background\n- **Current role:** [Title] at [Company] (since [date])\n- **Previous:** [Last 1-2 roles]\n- **Seniority:** [Level] | **Decision-maker:** [Likely Y/N]\n- **Notable:** [Anything interesting -- content, speaking, career path]\n\n### Buying Signals\n[List signals found, ordered by intent strength]\n- [High intent signal + evidence]\n- [Medium intent signal + evidence]\n- [Context signal + evidence]\n\n### Recommended Approach\n[2-3 sentences: Based on the signals and person profile, suggest\nthe best angle for outreach. Reference specific data points.\nE.g., \"They just raised Series B -- new budget cycle. Contact\nrecently posted about [topic]. Lead with [angle].\"]\n\n---\n\n**Sources:** [List all sources used]\n**Enriched:** [Date] | **Data freshness:** [Most recent source date]\n```\n\n## Step 4: Score the Lead\n\nAfter building the profile, assign a lead score:\n\n| Score | Label | Criteria |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| 9-10 | Hot | Multiple high-intent signals + decision-maker + ICP fit |\n| 7-8 | Warm | 1+ high-intent signal OR strong ICP fit + medium signals |\n| 5-6 | Interested | Medium signals, good fit, no urgency indicators |\n| 3-4 | Cool | Low signals, possible fit, worth nurturing |\n| 1-2 | Cold | No signals, poor fit, or stale data |\n\nInclude the score and reasoning in the output.\n\n## Batch Enrichment\n\nWhen enriching multiple leads from an ops table:\n\n1. Process leads in parallel (up to 5 at a time)\n2. Use the same agent architecture per lead\n3. Output a summary table first, then individual profiles on request\n4. Flag leads that need manual review (low confidence, conflicting data)\n\n**Summary table format:**\n\n```markdown\n| # | Name | Company | Title | Score | Top Signal | Email | Status |\n|---|------|---------|-------|-------|------------|-------|--------|\n| 1 | [Name] | [Co] | [Title] | 8/10 | Just raised Series B | Yes | Complete |\n| 2 | [Name] | [Co] | [Title] | 6/10 | Hiring 3 SDRs | Yes | Complete |\n| 3 | [Name] | [Co] | [Title] | ?/10 | -- | No | Needs review |\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### \"I only have a company name\"\nRun Company Intel and Signal Scanner agents. Skip Person Intel. Suggest key contacts to target based on leadership and org structure found.\n\n### \"I only have an email address\"\nUse the email to find the person''s name and company. Then run full enrichment. Apollo and AI Ark both support reverse email lookup.\n\n### \"Integrations aren''t enabled\"\nRun all enrichment using free web sources only. Note in the output which fields could be improved with integrations enabled. Recommend enabling Apollo for verified contact data and Apify for LinkedIn depth.\n\n### \"The person/company is very small or new\"\nSmaller companies have less public data. Lean heavily on website scraping, LinkedIn, and any social presence. Flag low-confidence fields clearly. A partial profile with honest confidence scores is better than a made-up complete one.\n\n### \"Data sources conflict\"\nWhen sources disagree:\n1. Prefer the most recent source\n2. Prefer verified/structured data (API) over scraped data\n3. Prefer first-party sources (company website, LinkedIn profile) over third-party\n4. Flag the conflict in the output so the salesperson knows\n\n## Data Quality Rules\n\nThese are non-negotiable:\n\n1. **Never fabricate data.** If you can''t find it, say so. A blank field with \"Not found\" is infinitely better than a guess.\n2. **Always cite your source.** Every data point should be traceable.\n3. **Flag confidence honestly.** Don''t mark something \"High\" if it came from a single unverified source.\n4. **Respect data freshness.** Anything over 6 months old gets flagged. Anything over 12 months gets marked stale.\n5. **Waterfall, don''t duplicate.** Use free sources first. Only call paid integrations for gaps or verification. Don''t burn credits on data you already have.\n6. **Protect privacy.** Don''t scrape or present personal data that isn''t business-relevant (home address, personal relationships, etc.).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:39:48.656Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing rapid sales lead intelligence gathering and enrichment capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要快速销售线索智能收集和增强能力的数据分析代理。","ja":"データ分析エージェントが迅速なセールスリードのインテリジェンス収集と強化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"데이터 분석 에이전트가 빠른 판매 리드 인텔리전스 수집 및 강화 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan recopilar y enriquecer rápidamente la inteligencia de los leads de ventas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''Analyse de Données ayant besoin de collecter et d''enrichir rapidement l''intelligence des leads de ventes.","de":"Perfekt für Data Analysis Agents, die eine schnelle Erfassung und Anreicherung von Vertriebslead-Intelligenz benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que precisam de capacidades rápidas de coleta e enriquecimento de inteligência de leads de vendas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым необходимы быстрые возможности сбора и обогащения разведданных о лидерах продаж.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل البيانات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات سريعة لجمع情報 وتحسين أداء مبيعات القيادة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform names and companies into comprehensive intelligence profiles using parallel research, providing faster and deeper insights without credit burn, leveraging capabilities like org-variables and company data analysis.","zh":"赋予代理人将姓名和公司转化为综合智能配置文件的能力，使用并行研究提供更快、更深入的洞察力，而无需信用燃烧，利用诸如组织变量和公司数据分析等功能。","ja":"エージェントに名前と会社を包括的なインテリジェンスプロファイルに変換する能力を付与し、並列研究を使用してクレジット消費せずに高速で深い洞察力を提供することで、org-variablesや会社データ分析などの機能を利用します。","ko":"에이전트에게 이름과 회사를 포함하는 인텔리전스 프로파일로 변환하는 능력을 부여하여 병렬 연구를 사용하여 신용 소모 없이 더 빠르고 깊은 통찰력을 제공하고, org-변수 및 회사 데이터 분석などの 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar nombres y empresas en perfiles de inteligencia completos utilizando investigaciones paralelas, proporcionando conocimientos más rápidos y profundos sin quemar créditos, aprovechando capacidades como org-variables y análisis de datos de empresas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des noms et des entreprises en profils d''intelligence complets en utilisant des recherches parallèles, fournissant ainsi des connaissances plus rapides et plus approfondies sans brûler de crédits, en exploitant des capacités comme les org-variables et l''analyse de données d''entreprises.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Namen und Unternehmen in umfassende Intelligenzprofile zu verwandeln, indem sie parallele Recherchen nutzen, um schnellere und tiefere Einblicke ohne Credit-Burn zu liefern, indem sie Fähigkeiten wie org-Variablen und Unternehmensdatenanalyse nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar nomes e empresas em perfis de inteligência abrangentes usando pesquisas paralelas, fornecendo insights mais rápidos e profundos sem queimar créditos, aproveitando capacidades como variáveis de organização e análise de dados de empresas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовать имена и компании в полные профили разведки с помощью параллельных исследований, обеспечивая более быстрые и глубокие идеи без сжигания кредитов, используя возможности такие как org-variables и анализ данных компаний.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل الأسماء والشركات إلى ملفات تعريف استخباراتية شاملة باستخدام البحث الموازّي، وتقديم رؤى أسرع وأعمق دون حرق رصيد، واستخدام قدرات مثل متغيرات المنظمة وتحليل بيانات الشركة."},"useCases":{"en":["Enriching sales leads with real-time company data","Automating lead qualification using advanced data analysis","Generating complete intelligence profiles for sales teams"],"zh":["使用实时公司数据丰富销售线索","使用高级数据分析自动化销售线索资格","为销售团队生成完整的智能配置文件"],"ja":["リアルタイムの会社データを使用してセールスリードを強化する","高度なデータ分析を使用してセールスリードの資格を自動化する","セールスチームのための包括的なインテリジェンスプロファイルを生成する"],"ko":["실시간 회사 데이터를 사용하여 판매 리드를 강화하는 것","고급 데이터 분석을 사용하여 리드 자격을 자동화하는 것","판매 팀을 위한 완전한 인텔리전스 프로파일을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Enriquecer los leads de ventas con datos de empresas en tiempo real","Automatizar la calificación de leads mediante análisis de datos avanzados","Generar perfiles de inteligencia completos para los equipos de ventas"],"fr":["Enrichir les leads de ventes avec des données d''entreprises en temps réel","Automatiser la qualification des leads à l''aide d''une analyse de données avancée","Générer des profils d''intelligence complets pour les équipes de ventes"],"de":["Vertriebsleads mit Echtzeit-Unternehmensdaten anreichern","Lead-Qualifizierung mit Hilfe von erweiterten Datenanalysen automatisieren","Vollständige Intelligenzprofile für Vertriebsteams generieren"],"pt":[" Enriquecimento de leads de vendas com dados de empresas em tempo real","Automatização da qualificação de leads usando análise de dados avançada","Geração de perfis de inteligência completos para equipes de vendas"],"ru":["Обогащение лидеров продаж данными компаний в реальном времени","Автоматизация квалификации лидеров с помощью продвинутого анализа данных","Генерация полных профилей разведки для команд продаж"],"ar":["تحسين أداء مبيعات القيادة مع بيانات الشركات في الوقت الفعلي","آليّة تصنيف القيادة باستخدام تحليل البيانات المتقدم","توليد ملفات تعريف استخباراتية كاملة لفريق المبيعات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to company and contact data sources","May not cover 100% of contacts due to single-source enrichment limitations","Needs integration with sales team''s existing data systems"],"zh":["需要访问公司和联系人数据源","可能无法涵盖 100% 的联系人由于单一来源的限制","需要与销售团队现有的数据系统集成"],"ja":["会社およびコンタクトデータソースへのアクセスが必要","シングルソースの制限により、100% のコンタクトをカバーできない場合がある","セールスチームの既存のデータシステムとの統合が必要"],"ko":["회사 및 연락처 데이터 소스에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","단일 소스의 제한으로 인해 100%의 연락처를 다루지 못할 수 있습니다.","판매 팀의 기존 데이터 시스템과 통합이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a fuentes de datos de empresas y contactos","Puede que no cubra el 100% de los contactos debido a las limitaciones de enriquecimiento de una sola fuente","Necesita integración con los sistemas de datos existentes del equipo de ventas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des sources de données d''entreprises et de contacts","Peut ne pas couvrir 100% des contacts en raison des limitations d''enrichissement d''une seule source","Nécessite une intégration avec les systèmes de données existants de l''équipe de ventes"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Unternehmens- und Kontakt-Datenquellen","Kann möglicherweise nicht 100% der Kontakte abdecken aufgrund von Einschränkungen bei der Anreicherung aus einer einzigen Quelle","Benötigt Integration mit den bestehenden Daten-Systemen des Vertriebsteams"],"pt":["Requer acesso a fontes de dados de empresas e contatos","Pode não cobrir 100% dos contatos devido a limitações de enriquecimento de fonte única","Necessita de integração com os sistemas de dados existentes da equipe de vendas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к источникам данных компаний и контактов","Может не охватывать 100% контактов из-за ограничений обогащения единого источника","Требует интеграции с существующими системами данных команды продаж"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مصادر بيانات الشركات والمخاطبين","قد لا يغطي 100% من المخاطبين بسبب قيود تحسين مصدر واحد","يحتاج إلى دمج مع أنظمة البيانات الحالية لفريق المبيعات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1419ceb13c115068714ea8b64eb1dafc959f9c9a2f802c20b3482aa4fcb48a2f","qualityScore":65}');
